 "text": "**Reasoning**\n\n1. Pollen germination uses sugar (sucrose) as its energy source → **B**\n2. A bacteriophage is a virus that destroys bacteria → **C**\n3. 'তেল নুন লকড়ি' was written by প্রমথ চৌধুরী → **C**\n4. Check each equation:\n   - A: 7×10 − 3 = 67\n   - B: 4 + 3×4÷2 = 10\n   - C: 7×4÷2 = 14. Only C gives 14 → **C**\n5. A younger sibling marrying while the elder is unmarried is called \"পরিবেদন\" → **B**\n6. The US wanted Israel to hand over 13% (Wye River accord) → **C**\n7. Japan is the only Asian country in the G-8 → **B**\n8. In photosynthesis, the oxygen comes from H₂O → **B**\n9. In \"পুকুরে মাছ আছে\", the fish are in only part of the pond, so it is ঐকদেশিক → **C**\n10. The matrix is [2,6,2; 6,2,24; 1,6,2].\n    - Determinant = 2(4−144) − 6(12−24) + 2(36−2)\n    - = −280 + 72 + 68 = −140 → **B**\n11. There are 5³ = 125 three-digit numbers with all odd digits, out of 900. So the probability is 125/900 = 5/36 → **B**\n12. The labial letters are প, ফ, ব, ভ, ম → **B**\n13. \"Justice delayed is justice denied\" is attributed to Gladstone → **C**\n14. The mushroom (ব্যাঙের ছাতা) is saprophytic → **B**\n15. Rabindranath Tagore was born in 1861 and won the Nobel in 1913, at age 52 → **B**\n\n{\"answers\": {\"786939d8-d543-41d1-a19d-b40c04941a24-76149\": \"B\", \"7945412f-7c84-4e3d-b3d8-d5d255393e9f-9695\": \"C\", \"79ed2aff-2c2d-49d8-aa44-d3950eb72a19-31604\": \"C\", \"79f100d6-e2fa-4ead-b4ee-7939892b334a-108775\": \"C\", \"79f1a5d5-c281-4201-86f6-679badb71b2c-64213\": \"B\", \"7a168d29-47e7-422f-9839-d6c5a407102c-119661\": \"C\", \"7af7c46d-7f9d-4509-a15a-cada63a06eeb-119150\": \"B\", \"7afed0ec-9e99-47dd-9e54-28b3b4d1e833-77734\": \"B\", \"7b203072-8dd1-48a6-8a5a-d54cd75b8b49-37134\": \"C\", \"7b3b674b-5fa2-43b6-968b-5cbd54672d16-103384\": \"B\", \"7c251935-e4bc-4d23-82b4-d4046d038e9f-29154\": \"B\", \"7ccd4ba8-eea9-44f6-8acc-018b47bd25e5-100739\": \"B\", \"7de0d68f-79d8-4afe-9f58-b58a6beb694c-101942\": \"C\", \"7e71b668-8f64-4653-8af0-8e921845690d-2